#: ../source/notebooks/clv/bg_nbd.ipynb:370002 887a4a1ab9644c5abf2c1be870cb03e5
msgid "Expected Number of Purchases"
msgstr "Número Esperado de Compras"

#: ../source/notebooks/clv/bg_nbd.ipynb:380002 e58e9c36eaff4eaa9d9ed5f5b761d23a
msgid "Let us take a sample of users:"
msgstr "Tomemos una muestra de usuarios:"

#: ../source/notebooks/clv/bg_nbd.ipynb:400002 7fdf5d74253748a788e7d5b1730b31b5
msgid ""
"Observe that the last two customers are *frequent buyers* as compared to "
"the others."
msgstr ""
"Observe que los últimos dos clientes son *compradores frecuentes* en "
"comparación con los demás."

#: ../source/notebooks/clv/bg_nbd.ipynb:420002 a43452a4b94a4e208b767adeb99e20e4
msgid "We can plot the expected number of purchases for the next $90$ periods:"
msgstr ""
"Podemos trazar el número esperado de compras para los próximos $90$ "
"períodos:"

#: ../source/notebooks/clv/bg_nbd.ipynb:440002 f71c317d326d4be9a6b5e9c81cd9218c
msgid ""
"Note that the *frequent buyers* are expected to make more purchases in "
"the future."
msgstr ""
"Tenga en cuenta que se espera que los *compradores frecuentes* realicen "
"más compras en el futuro."

#: ../source/notebooks/clv/bg_nbd.ipynb:450002 1d1d4c46401e473283ba53ca0218ce3e
msgid "Probability of a Customer Being Alive"
msgstr "Probabilidad de que un Cliente esté Vivo"

#: ../source/notebooks/clv/bg_nbd.ipynb:450004 a133a4b73ce348e4900b2e8bef42f956
msgid ""
"We now look into the probability of a customer being alive for the next "
"$90$ periods:"
msgstr ""
"Ahora examinamos la probabilidad de que un cliente esté vivo durante los "
"próximos $90$ períodos:"

#: ../source/notebooks/clv/bg_nbd.ipynb:480003 868df701c3784c89a051692998f2dabe
msgid "Here are some general remarks:"
msgstr "Aquí hay algunas observaciones generales:"

#: ../source/notebooks/clv/bg_nbd.ipynb:480004 e0f3f8a61cf340d78dc7debe4a382775
msgid "**These plots assume no future purchases.**"
msgstr "**Estos gráficos suponen que no habrá compras futuras.**"

#: ../source/notebooks/clv/bg_nbd.ipynb:480005 34fc5d3f8df04c81acaa7b54e0049059
msgid ""
"The decay probability is not the same as it depends in the purchase "
"history of the customer."
msgstr ""
"La probabilidad de descomposición no es la misma, ya que depende del "
"historial de compras del cliente."

#: ../source/notebooks/clv/bg_nbd.ipynb:480006 314d46726b3d44a79179dcee33f9c952
msgid ""
"The probability of being alive is always decreasing as we are assuming "
"there is no change in the other parameters."
msgstr ""
"La probabilidad de estar vivo siempre está disminuyendo, ya que asumimos "
"que no hay cambios en los otros parámetros."

#: ../source/notebooks/clv/bg_nbd.ipynb:480007 180e550dd665412483349358ae51e7e6
msgid "These probabilities are always non-negative, as expected."
msgstr "Estas probabilidades son siempre no negativas, como se esperaba."

#: ../source/notebooks/clv/bg_nbd.ipynb:480011 ab159d816dbb4fa9b783950cc137b815
msgid ""
"For the frequent buyers, the probability of being alive drops very fast "
"as we are assuming no future purchases. It is very important to keep this"
" in mind when interpreting the results."
msgstr ""
"Para los compradores frecuentes, la probabilidad de estar vivos disminuye"
" muy rápidamente ya que asumimos que no habrá compras futuras. Es muy "
"importante tener esto en cuenta al interpretar los resultados."

#: ../source/notebooks/clv/bg_nbd.ipynb:490002 b119e4581ba047fb82d1b9921c1f148b
msgid "Probability of a Customer Making Zero Purchases in a time range"
msgstr ""
"Probabilidad de que un cliente no realice ninguna compra en un rango de "
"tiempo"

#: ../source/notebooks/clv/bg_nbd.ipynb:490004 1d9fbff93b3b4c169866303a06c8b496
msgid ""
"We now look into the probability of a customer making 0 purchases between"
" now, and the next $t$ periods between 0 and 30."
msgstr ""
"Ahora analizamos la probabilidad de que un cliente realice 0 compras "
"entre ahora y los próximos $t$ períodos, que van de 0 a 30."

